Package: UKBPSPRSxOSA
Title: Pathway-Specific Polygenic Risk Scores for Coronary Artery Disease
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Code accompanying Goodman MO et al., Circ Genom Precis Med
    2022;15(5):e003535. This file declares the R packages the repository uses;
    setup/setup_renv.R reads it to build the project library. The repository
    is not an installable R package.
